Subject: [PATCH] routine: Screenshot: line on entries; derive reads image
 mockups
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- routine-base.md: Screenshot: sub-bullet documented in <todo_format>, opened
  with the Read tool in <implementation> step 2, deleted in the completion
  commit (<git_workflow> step 3).
- derive.md / project-derive.md: drop the 'cannot read images' rule — the Read
  tool renders images (visual verification already relies on it); a sibling
  README spec still wins where it and the picture differ.
- mockups-README.md / README.md: same, plus the docs/context/ convention.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
